  "completed": [
    "Caseload reads no longer accept pending invitations or mutate membership. Caller-visible students receive literal canonical reading/editing checks and Partner-only exclusion, including final capability rechecks.",
    "Overview/actions/notes/readiness use every exact-count page, stable ordering and bounded100-student filters. Failed, duplicate, foreign or incomplete records never become false empty/zero success. Newest readiness scores use actual timestamps.",
    "Quick actions use the existing held-authority planning creation RPC; legacy teacher maps to Educator. Unsupported Partner-category quick creation is rejected; existing rows remain unchanged.",
    "Shared reader lifetimes hide old account data and reject departed/out-of-order responses. Read-only quick tools and action toggles honor loaded capability; uncertain saves require explicit refresh.",
    "Student detail and edit-capability handlers validate exact account/student/current proof. The signed-in readiness page no longer displays default fictional heatmap rows.",
    "Quick-note writes add current-edit precheck and exact actor/student/request/content receipts, with no retries. This does not close transaction-held note authority or contributor/private-note semantics."
  ],
